### [the fallen span](span_solid)
---
Relic: voice
Solid: capsule, -1100, -300, -700, -100, 300, 700, 160
---
A structural spar down across the concourse. It has been there a long time.

DIAGONAL, and it stops short of the walls. Squared off across the room it spanned the
whole width and left a 240u slot at each end - an accidental chokepoint the plan view
does not show you, because a solid reads as a hole rather than as a wall. Set on the
diagonal it is something to fly around, which is what it is for.

